.* STATUS: the task menu for status.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='STATUS'.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKACTJOB PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKCFGSTS PNLGRP=QHDCCMD1.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKDSKSTS PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKSBMJOB PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKSBS PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKSHRPOOL PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKSYSSTS PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKUSRJOB PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKWTR PNLGRP=QHSPCMD.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS' NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=STATUS HELP=HLPSTATUS KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Status
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI HELP=WRKWTR OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD WRKWTR'.Work with printers
:MENUI HELP=WRKUSRJOB OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD WRKUSRJOB'.Work with jobs
:MENUI HELP=WRKSBMJOB OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD WRKSBMJOB'.Work with submitted jobs
:MENUI HELP=WRKACTJOB OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD WRKACTJOB'.Work with all active job statistics
:MENUI HELP=WRKSBS OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD WRKSBS'.Work with active subsystems
:MENUI HELP=WRKSYSSTS OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD WRKSYSSTS'.Display system status
:MENUI HELP=WRKCFGSTS OPTION=7 ACTION='CMD ?WRKCFGSTS'.Work with configuration status
:MENUI HELP=WRKDSKSTS OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD WRKDSKSTS'.Work with disk status
:MENUI HELP='STATUS/OPT9' OPTION=9 ACTION='MENU CMNSTS'.Communications status
:MENUI HELP=WRKSHRPOOL OPTION=10 ACTION='CMD WRKSHRPOOL'.Work with shared pools
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPSTATUS.Status - Help
:P.How the system is doing right now: jobs, subsystems, storage pools,
disks and devices.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F13=Information Assistant
:PD.Shows menu INFO.
:PT.F16=System Main menu
:PD.Shows menu MAIN.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='STATUS/OPT9'.Communications status
:P.Option 9. Shows menu CMNSTS&colon. Communications status.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
